  "version": 1,
  "note": "DRAFT. The single ledger of every stat id: its layer, its principle, and its owners. Written from the 2026-10-07 design sessions (15 primaries, 3 paths x 5 principles). Weights are placeholders pending the impact census and play data; the test in tests/contracts/test_stat_ledger.gd reconciles this file against the live vocabulary and prints the distribution report. Move-for-correctness applied: absorption is TANG (soaking is containment); parry.rate is LIU; block.rate is TANG; illusion_resistance and reflect.resist.rate are LIU. Flagged, not moved: qi_affinity (L2-or-Sinh), reflect.* (Luyen stands), mental_clarity (candidate merge with sea_clarity). Rounds 2026-10-07: v1 counted exclusive owners; v2 made every channel a weighted participation of its principle's cells. A weight-cap pass (.70 then .62) moved the spread 2.77x -> 2.43x and the lesson is the round's result: caps DILUTE identity without compressing the spread, because the spread is HOME-COUNT structure. The residual (mind_soul 3.58 low, body_foundation 8.69 high) is to be closed by WIDENING the thin cells with non-combat channels, not by shaving the home weights. Non-combat block 2026-10-07: 18 new channels (crafting x5, gathering/market x4, social/fertility x3, aging/rest x3, construction/wards x2, exploration x1) homed on thin cells where the fiction allows — spread 2.43x -> 2.01x, domains combat 74 / non_combat 25 / both 10, principles 17.4/16.5/22.9/22.9/20.2. mind_soul stays the thinnest cell on purpose: the soul system is the youngest layer and its channels are the last to be authored. Enrichment round 2026-10-07 (b): the social (3) and dual-cultivation (19) vocabularies entered the ledger, plus five new sub-features the systems will be built around (soul_anchor, reincarnation_memory, soul_age, momentum, footwork) and two retired ids as legacy (mind_avoidance, mind_focus_chance). Result: spread 2.01x -> 1.71x (lowest body_grace 7.17, highest mind_stability 12.23), domains combat 76 / non_combat 48 / both 10, principles sinh 17.2 / phat 19.4 / tang 24.6 / luyen 20.9 / luu 17.9. Enrichment round 2026-10-07 (c): a sweep of every module stats file collected the vocabularies the four reconciled lists cannot see - race markers (6, innate), clan (9), clan_building (5), bloodline (5), fertility (7) and relationships (4). Grown channels got weights; STATE READOUTS (indices, counters, markers) got a source and no owners, which is the round's structural gain: the ledger tells 'what you grow' apart from 'what you read'. Result: spread 1.71x -> 1.76x, domains combat 76 / non_combat 58 / both 10, principles sinh 18.8 / phat 18.7 / tang 25.0 / luyen 20.1 / luu 17.4. Scope: resource POOLS (health/qi/stamina) and the L4 element/status families are deliberately not rows; their masteries own them. 2026-10-07 (d): status_resistance's remaining live surfaces removed (presenter entry, ZERO_BASELINE_STATS membership, current-tense docs); the tombstone and this legacy row are kept, and the dead core_status_resistance carriers are DEF-0357. 2026-10-07 (e): A1-A7 ruled - diacritic labels applied to the fifteen primaries (A5), qi_affinity grown (A1), sea_clarity row reconciled to legacy (BL-0163 truth), A3 needs a corrected pick (see DEF-0358); P1-P15 status-port picks recorded in DEF-0363. 2026-10-07 (f): A3a-2 executed (ADR 0900) - mental_clarity retired to legacy; perception carries the mind's offence and will the defence; the four technique carriers merged into cult_perception and the option is deprecated.",
